{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cardboard Cowboy is a Western shooter set in a world made entirely out of cardboard!\u00a0Survive shooting galleries, collect tarot cards, and use various cardboard firearms in different locations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/4e9b1bcc6e3a76059cdfdfbdd63ddb49.avif?t=1761891481\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/ae9b58cb23781f39b208a7a595f96001.poster.avif?t=1761891481\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/ae9b58cb23781f39b208a7a595f96001.webm?t=1761891481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/ae9b58cb23781f39b208a7a595f96001.mp4?t=1761891481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the timed weapon challenges for extra loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rack up kills and headshots to set high scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience multiple ending missions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856780/extras/9c454cf8d2e4401afc94185edfebb9a3.avif?t=1761891481\" width=600 height=115 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tarot cards for passive traits and active abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new tarot cards to become the ultimate gunslinger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate ability cards to shoot incendiary, poison, or ricochet ammo</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"